  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Meng Qiu, Nu Er Tu’s leopard group hisses and growls through a bloody fight with Jiang Bao Ya’s rats. Mutated leopards stand beside Nu Er Tu. Jiang Bao Ya, pale and sweating, answers with Rat Epidemic: hundreds of thousands of rats self-destruct, yellow poison gas covers the surviving leopards, and they become sickly and slow, while Jiang Bao Ya’s remaining rats move through the gas without being affected. Nu Er Tu, who had intended to keep hiding it, shouts. The leopard group howls and unfolds a mad charge, breaks out of the poison gas, breathes fresh air, and overruns the field.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_nu_er_tu",
        "char_jiang_bao_ya",
        "move_rat_epidemic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan exchanges battle merits for the recorded journal of four enslavement masters. That journal lists this killer move as leopard rush, together with rat epidemic, thunder explosion, and horse barrage.",
      "chapters": [
        546
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "enslavement-masters-journal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names leopard rush among the killer moves merged into Myriad Self, together with dragon horse spirit, three heads six arms, rat epidemic, thunder explosion, horse barrage, three hearts combination soul, beast phantoms, and six arm heavenly zombie king.",
